abstract: Four accepted Lean proofs complete the uniform quadratic candidate family
  and establish actual knapsack optimization and rounding guarantees for nested-logit
  assortments. Exact sources, pinned reproduction and rejecting controls are included.
  Alexander Richard Towell directed; OpenAI Codex substantially formalized and verified.
  Source/platform/library credit is retained; no mathematical novelty or independent
  human review claimed.
